      "blurb": "Fanatical hanar Enkindler devotee",
      "publicNotes": "<p>Hanar cultists associated with the Enkindler movement have moved beyond reverence into active operationalization of their beliefs-which in practice means they are prepared to do significant harm to those they believe stand against the will of the Enkindlers, and they are terrifyingly calm about it. Their bioluminescent communication is highly trained, allowing for group coordination without audible speech.</p><p><strong>Amphibious:</strong> Can breathe air and water. Swim speed 35 ft.</p><p><strong>Enkindler's Grace:</strong> Once per round as a free action, grants one ally within 30 ft +1 circ. bonus to attacks and saves until end of ally's next turn.</p><p><strong>Bioluminescent Display (2 actions):</strong> DC 18 Will save or dazzled 1 minute; stunned 1 on critical failure. Visual, cone 20 ft.</p><p><strong>Kinetic Barrier:</strong> 30 Shield HP. Recharges 9 HP per turn.</p>",
